wh40k-class-specialization-soldier-long-shadow-name = Eye of the Void
wh40k-class-specialization-soldier-long-shadow-description = Observation, marksman weapons, and prepared shots.

wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-01-name = Long-Shot Doctrine
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-01-description = Unlocks the sniper stance. Effects require a suitable single-shot rifle or marksman weapon.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-02-name = Cold Trigger
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-02-description = The first shot after a brief calm wait has less spread; running, taking damage, or sustained fire resets preparation.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-03-name = Observation Sector
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-03-description = Watching one visible area gradually marks spotted hostile NPCs for the Soldier without revealing hidden targets through walls.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-04-name = Hold Breath
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-04-description = Briefly fixes the stance and sharply reduces spread for the next shot. Movement, a shove, or weapon change cancels it.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-05-name = Calibrated Range
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-05-description = Reduces long-range accuracy penalties without increasing damage of every hit.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-06-name = Relocate the Nest
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-06-description = After firing, enables a brief accelerated retreat to a nearby clear point. It is movement, not invisibility or teleportation.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-07-name = Sightline Thread
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-07-description = Hitting an observed target retains its personal mark a little longer; losing direct sight removes it.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-08-name = Shoot the Gap
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-08-description = An accurate hit on a marked target briefly weakens one defined defense or armor layer, still respecting armor and cover.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-09-name = Flawless Chambering
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-09-description = Rifle cycling after one accurate shot is faster, but uncontrolled bursts grant no bonus.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-10-name = Commander's Eye
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-10-description = Marks a visible priority target for the group with a timer and direction. This is squad coordination, not global player detection.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-11-name = Read the Wind
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-11-description = The sight clearly displays current spread penalties and gains a small accuracy cap, never automatic aiming.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-12-name = Stop the Rush
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-12-description = A prepared hit briefly slows a hostile NPC or interrupts its charge if the projectile actually reaches it; no control passes through walls.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-13-name = Silhouette Memory
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-13-description = After briefly losing sight, only the Soldier sees the marked target's last known position, which quickly fades. Requires a private HUD marker.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-14-name = Clean Work
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-14-description = Eliminating a marked dangerous target restores some preparation time, but no ammunition, health, or skill points.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-15-name = False Position
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-15-description = Places a short-lived laser or sound distraction for NPCs at a visible point. It is not a clone and reveals no enemies.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-16-name = One Round
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-16-description = The last round in a magazine gains accuracy rather than damage; the Soldier must reload afterward.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-17-name = Pierce the Screen
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-17-description = With special suitable ammunition, a prepared shot can penetrate one soft target or light obstacle. Airlocks, walls, and heavy armor still protect.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-18-name = Elusive Silhouette
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-18-description = Relocating or landing a long-range hit delays NPC reacquisition. It does not affect players or grant invisibility.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-19-name = Execute the Target
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-19-description = A slowly prepared shot against a visible, long-marked priority target, trading mobility and a long cooldown for high focused pressure.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-20-name = Verdict at Range
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-long-shadow-20-description = Final node: a prepared long-range shot against the Soldier's own mark gains one controlled accuracy and penetration modifier. It fails at close range, through cover, or with unsuitable weapons.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierHoldBreath = Hold breath
    .desc = Prepare the next precise shot; movement, damage, or attacking cancels preparation.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierChangeNest = Change nest
    .desc = Physically withdraw to a neighboring visible point along a clear path.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierGapShot = Gap shot
    .desc = Prepare a precise shot against a visible marked target.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierCommanderEye = Commander's eye
    .desc = Place a personal timed mark on a visible target.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierStopRunner = Stop runner
    .desc = Subsequent hits suppress NPCs near the impact point.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierFalsePosition = False position
    .desc = Distract a limited number of NPCs in the selected visible area.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierPierceScreen = Pierce screen
    .desc = Prepare the next long-range shot from a stationary position.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierExecuteTarget = Execute target
    .desc = Slowly prepare a precise shot against the Soldier's own visible mark.

wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-01-name = Field Hardened
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-01-description = Permanently reduces incoming normal and stamina damage by 2%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-02-name = Second Wind
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-02-description = Increases natural stamina recovery by 1 per second.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-03-name = Nerve Steadiness
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-03-description = Newly applied stun lasts 10% less time.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-04-name = Light Kit
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-04-description = Compensates 20% of the permanent movement penalty from marksman weapons.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-05-name = Combat Dash
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-05-description = The Soldier's shared Combat Dash; this mirror point spends no skill point.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-06-name = Firm Mount
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-06-description = Reduces marksman weapon spread growth by 10%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-07-name = Smooth Trigger
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-07-description = Speeds spread decay after a shot by 20%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-08-name = Composed Sight
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-08-description = Reduces marksman weapon maximum spread by 10%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-09-name = Equanimity
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-09-description = Reduces only stamina damage dealt by enemy weapons by 10%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-10-name = Hold Breath
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-10-description = For 12 seconds improves semi-auto projectile speed, rate, and accuracy; movement, damage, or changing weapons breaks it.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-11-name = Rangefinder
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-11-description = Increases marksman projectile speed by 10%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-12-name = Bolt Work
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-12-description = Increases semi-auto firing rate by 5%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-13-name = Dry Trigger
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-13-description = Reduces extra spread from moving semi-auto fire by 20%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-14-name = Measured Withdrawal
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-14-description = For 3 seconds after a semi-auto shot, Combat Dash costs 2 less stamina.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-15-name = Verdict Shot
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-15-description = After preparation, grants three enhanced semi-auto shots with increased armor penetration.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-16-name = Hit Confirmation
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-16-description = A real marksman hit quietly confirms itself only to the shooter.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-17-name = Cold Calculation
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-17-description = Reduces marksman camera recoil by 15%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-18-name = Vulnerable Target
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-18-description = Deals 5% more damage to a target below 70% remaining health.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-19-name = Clean Line
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-19-description = After 3 seconds standing still, reduces marksman weapon spread by 15%.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-20-name = Priority Target
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-20-description = Places a private cross mark on one visible hostile target for 15 seconds; hits deal it 5% more damage.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-21-name = Short Withdrawal
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-21-description = With a marksman weapon, reduces Combat Dash cooldown to 4 seconds.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-22-name = Quiet Withdrawal
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-22-description = Shortens the semi-auto post-shot movement penalty to 0.25 seconds.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-23-name = Dry Reserve
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-23-description = With a marksman weapon, reduces Combat Dash cost to 7 stamina.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-24-name = Withdrawal Route
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-24-description = With a marksman weapon, increases Combat Dash range to 4 tiles.
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-25-name = Nest Relocation
wh40k-class-skill-soldier-void-eye-25-description = Prepare four points and traverse them strictly in order; the cycle recovers after 5 minutes.

ent-ActionWh40kSoldierVoidHoldBreath = Hold Breath
    .desc = Prepare several precise semi-auto shots.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierVoidVerdictShot = Verdict Shot
    .desc = Prepare three exceptionally precise semi-auto shots.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierVoidPriorityTarget = Priority Target
    .desc = Mark one visible hostile target with a private cross.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierVoidNestPlace = Place Point
    .desc = Place the next point of the prepared route.
ent-ActionWh40kSoldierVoidNestAdvance = Advance to Next Point
    .desc = Rapidly travel to the next point of a completed route.
